# Short link to the self-hosted APK. The real file is served statically from
# dist/download/sporefall.apk (bundled by the deploy workflow) — a real file wins
# over the SPA fallback, so these just give it friendly URLs. We serve the APK
# from OUR site (not GitHub) because the repo is private and its release assets
# are auth-walled.
/download      /download/sporefall.apk  302
/download/     /download/sporefall.apk  302
/get           /download/sporefall.apk  302

# SPA fallback (serve index.html for deep links / refreshes) is handled by
# wrangler.jsonc's assets `not_found_handling: "single-page-application"`. A
# `/*  /index.html  200` rule here is redundant and newer wrangler rejects it as
# an infinite-loop redirect (code 100324), so it lives in wrangler config, not here.
